                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W4408200                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  PROGRAMMET LÄSER RESTORDERFILEN W44061 OCH SKRIVER EN *        
*                LISTA ÖVER RESTORDER SOM ÄR ÄLDRE ÄN CA 6 MÅN.        *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  LINDQVIST CHRISTINE                                   *        
*                                                                      *        
*  ÄNDRING    :                                                        *        
*                                                                      *        
*     DATUM       NAMN                     AVDELNING                   *        
*     ......      ..................       ......                      *        
*     ......      ..................       ......                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W44082D1                                                                   
%W44060                                                                         
                                                                                
%WORKAREA                                                                       
                                                                                
FILE W44082D2 PRINTER VB (173 0)                                                
                                                                                
W-IDDISTR            W 3 P                                                      
W-IDKUNDNR           W 4 P                                                      
W-IDARTNR            W 5 P                                                      
W-TIREGDAT           W 6 N  MASK (A BWZ '999999')                               
W-TIRODAT            W 6 N  MASK (B BWZ '999999')                               
W-TITPO              W 6 N  MASK (C BWZ '999999')                               
W-RODAT              W 4 P                                                      
                                                                                
WS-TIRODAT           W 6 N                                                      
                                                                                
W-DATUM                W 8 A                                                    
W-AA      W-DATUM        2 N                                                    
W-MM      W-DATUM +3     2 N                                                    
W-DD      W-DATUM +6     2 N                                                    
                                                                                
W-DATUM2              W  6 N                                                    
W-AA2     W-DATUM2       2 N                                                    
W-MM2     W-DATUM2 +2    2 N                                                    
W-DD2     W-DATUM2 +4    2 N                                                    
                                                                                
RKOD-16              W 3 P 0  VALUE 16                                          
                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                    WORKING STORAGE                             *              
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                                                                               
W-SEM1               W   1  A   VALUE ';'                                       
W-SEM2               W   1  A   VALUE ';'                                       
W-SEM3               W   1  A   VALUE ';'                                       
W-SEM4               W   1  A   VALUE ';'                                       
W-SEM5               W   1  A   VALUE ';'                                       
W-SEM6               W   1  A   VALUE ';'                                       
W-SEM7               W   1  A   VALUE ';'                                       
W-SEM8               W   1  A   VALUE ';'                                       
W-SEM9               W   1  A   VALUE ';'                                       
W-SEM10              W   1  A   VALUE ';'                                       
W-SEM11              W   1  A   VALUE ';'                                       
RCOUNT               W   8  N   VALUE  0                                        
WS-FIRST-REC         W   1  A   VALUE 'J'                                       
                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
%WY2000W1                                                                       
JOB INPUT (W44082D1)  +                                                         
        START A-INIT                                                            
                                                                                
  TMP1-YYMMDD = RAD-TIREGDAT                                                    
  TMP2-YYMMDD = W-RODAT                                                         
  PERFORM WY2000P1                                                              
  IF RAD-IDDISTR NE 98                                                          
    IF RAD-KDSTARAD = '2', '3' AND +                                            
       TMP1-YYMMDD < TMP2-YYMMDD                                                
       W-IDDISTR  = RAD-IDDISTR                                                 
       W-IDKUNDNR = RAD-IDKUNDNR                                                
       W-IDARTNR  = RAD-IDARTNR                                                 
       W-TIREGDAT = RAD-TIREGDAT                                                
       W-TIRODAT  = WS-TIRODAT                                                  
       WS-TIRODAT = RAD-DARODAT                                                 
       W-TITPO    = RAD-TITPO                                                   
       PRINT W44082                                                             
    END-IF                                                                      
  END-IF                                                                        
                                                                                
A-INIT. PROC                                                                    
  MOVE SYSDATE      TO W-DATUM                                                  
                                                                                
  W-AA2    = W-AA                                                               
  W-MM2    = W-MM                                                               
  W-DD2    = W-DD                                                               
                                                                                
  WORK-IDDC              = '11'                                                 
  WORK-KDCALL            = 003                                                  
  WORK-TIAAMMDD-TOM      = W-DATUM2                                             
  WORK-KVWORKD           = 130                                                  
                                                                                
  CALL WORKDAY USING (WORK-KDCALL             +                                 
                      WORK-DATE-AREA          +                                 
                      WORK-KDSVAR)                                              
  IF WORK-KDSVAR EQ 'F'                                                         
    RETURN-CODE = RKOD-16                                                       
    STOP EXECUTE                                                                
  ELSE                                                                          
    W-RODAT = WORK-TIAAMMDD-FOM                                                 
  END-IF                                                                        
                                                                                
  DISPLAY W44082D2 '¤DAPW44082-001'                                             
  DISPLAY W44082D2 '¤DAPW44082'                                                 
                                                                                
END-PROC                                                                        
%WY2000P1                                                                       
                                                                                
*                                                                               
REPORT W44082    DTLCTL  EVERY                               +                  
                 PRINTER W44082D2                            +                  
                 LINESIZE     168                            +                  
                 NODATE                                      +                  
                 NOADJUST                                    +                  
                 NOSPREAD                                    +                  
                 PAGESIZE       32767                        +                  
                 NOPAGE                                      +                  
                 SPACE          0                                               
*                                                                               
SEQUENCE RAD-IDDISTR       +                                                    
         RAD-IDKUNDNR      +                                                    
         RAD-KDSTARAD      +                                                    
         RAD-IDKUNDRF      +                                                    
         RAD-TIREGDAT                                                           
TITLE 1  'VOLVO CAR PARTS      W44082-001  RESTORDER ÄLDRE ÄN' W-RODAT +        
         '                                   '                                  
TITLE 2  'STATUS 2 = RESTORDER  STATUS 3 = RESERVERADE RESTORDER'               
                                                                                
HEADING  W-IDDISTR       'DISTR'                                                
HEADING  W-SEM1          ';'                                                    
HEADING  W-IDKUNDNR      ' KUNDNR'                                              
HEADING  W-SEM2          ';'                                                    
HEADING  RAD-KDSTARAD    'STA'                                                  
HEADING  W-SEM3          ';'                                                    
HEADING  RAD-IDKUNDRF    'ORDER    '                                            
HEADING  W-SEM4          ';'                                                    
HEADING  W-IDARTNR       '   ARTNR'                                             
HEADING  W-SEM5          ';'                                                    
HEADING  RAD-KVART       '   ANTAL'                                             
HEADING  W-SEM6          ';'                                                    
HEADING  RAD-IDANSK      'ANSK'                                                 
HEADING  W-SEM7          ';'                                                    
HEADING  RAD-IDDC        'DC'                                                   
HEADING  W-SEM8          ';'                                                    
HEADING  W-TIREGDAT      'REGDAT'                                               
HEADING  W-SEM9          ';'                                                    
HEADING  W-TIRODAT       'RODAT'                                                
HEADING  W-SEM10         ';'                                                    
HEADING  W-TITPO         'TPODAT'                                               
HEADING  W-SEM11         ';'                                                    
                                                                                
LINE     W-IDDISTR        +                                                     
         W-SEM1           +                                                     
         W-IDKUNDNR       +                                                     
         W-SEM1           +                                                     
         RAD-KDSTARAD     +                                                     
         W-SEM1           +                                                     
         RAD-IDKUNDRF     +                                                     
         W-SEM1           +                                                     
         W-IDARTNR        +                                                     
         W-SEM1           +                                                     
         RAD-KVART        +                                                     
         W-SEM1           +                                                     
         RAD-IDANSK       +                                                     
         W-SEM1           +                                                     
         RAD-IDDC         +                                                     
         W-SEM1           +                                                     
         W-TIREGDAT       +                                                     
         W-SEM1           +                                                     
         W-TIRODAT        +                                                     
         W-SEM1           +                                                     
         W-TITPO          +                                                     
         W-SEM1                                                                 
 NEWPAGE                                                                        
*                                                                               
